SUMMARY:Monthly Support Group – Siblings Only
DESCRIPTION:Siblings Only Monthly Support Group meets on the last Monday of each month from 7:00 pm to 8:30 pm. The sibling relationship is a unique one\, with its own challenges\, especially when your sibling is living with persistent mental health challenges. You are not alone. Please join this Siblings ONLY group for support\, perspective\, and understanding. \nRSVP to Renee at rfolzenlogen@mhainspire.org for the link to join.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/monthly-support-group-siblings-only/2026-10-26/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:Support Groups
END:VEVENT
