SUMMARY:Parent Academy - October: From Friendship Drama to Healthy Relationships
DESCRIPTION:Friendship ups and downs are a normal part of growing up but knowing how to respond can make all the difference. This workshop provides parents and caregivers with strategies to help children manage peer conflict\, cope with social exclusion\, navigate digital drama\, and build healthy friendships. Participants will also learn when to step in\, when to coach from the sidelines\, and how to foster resilience through life’s social challenges.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/parent-academy-october-from-friendship-drama-to-healthy-relationships/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:NJ4S
END:VEVENT
