SUMMARY:Family Support Group - Wednesday Evening
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday Evening Family Support Group\, 7 pm -8:30 pm: This virtual\, year-round group meets every 1st and 3rd Wednesday of the month via Zoom and is designed for family members (parents\, spouses and partners\, siblings\, adult offspring) of people with mental illness to gain support and perspective about mental illness in the family\, in a facilitated\, confidential discussion group. \nContact Renee at rfolzenlogen@mhainspire.org
